  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). Steam app 330830 (\"Tales from the Borderlands\" in the store list; the schema has no game name). \"New Tales from the Borderlands\" (app 1454970) is a different game and was not used. The 35 Steam achievements are all story progress, none hidden: six chapter completions and one episode completion for each of the five episodes, so every one is reached just by playing. Episode names for One to Four come from RAWG's separate episode entries; RAWG has no entry for Episode Five and no fetched data names it, so the chapter is just \"Episode Five\" (borderlands.fandom.com links a page \"The Vault of the Traveler (Tales from the Borderlands)\", which may be it, but that was not confirmed). StrategyWiki has no page under \"Tales from the Borderlands\" or \"Tales from the Borderlands: A Telltale Game Series\". borderlands.fandom.com answers the API under \"Tales from the Borderlands\", with about 75 linked articles; names only were looked at, nothing copied."
